* {{audio|es-donde.ogg|Audio}}

===Adverb===
{{es-adv}}

# {{context|in indirect questions}} [[where]], in [[what]] [[place]].
#: {{usex|Deja los libros '''donde''' quieras.|translation=Leave the books where you want.}}

